ind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.3.2: New Enemy and Improvements","summary":"Demo Update 1.3.2Thank you for suggesting improvements! This update improves movement animations, introduces a new enemy in the demo, adds custom keyboard support and some missing key bindings from earlier versions. On top of that, Doomed Crew is participating in the Steam Scream V Fest, 2026.New EnemyNot all crates are safe. Not all crates have bombs in them either. Some crates just run a spinning saw blade through you!Balancing & FixesAdded options for looking and movement key rebindsCustom ke","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T13:21:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041927","verified_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1846651706691244","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Doomed Crew is Live in the Steam Next Fest, play the Demo now!","summary":"Mimics are waiting. Doomed Crew is a part of the Steam Next Fest, October 2026, running from October 19th to 26th.In the Demo:You (and your team) will have to identify yourselves, fight or avoid mimics and other enemies to complete whatever tasks your corporation threw at you. Get access to one map and objective, along with a combination of optional, randomized small tasks that grant you a bonus. Lock yourself in an exit, and hope it to be the right one, because a fake one will literally throw y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:53:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691244","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1846651706684329","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.3.1: The Next Fest Update","summary":"Demo Update 1.3.1Doomed Crew is preparing for the Next Fest, October, 2026.Balancing & ImprovementsPlayers can now respawn after being turned into a stone, in lower difficultiesEMP Doors aren't instantly lethal in lower difficultiesUI improvements in the menu and in the workbenchA few item icons have been changedEmpty vending machines can't be interacted anymoreFixesFixed a major issue where players could suddenly drop dead in the lobbyFixed an issue where exiting to the menu could cause a black","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T11:03:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684329","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1846018067935925","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Voice Stealing - Demo 1.3.0","summary":"Doomed Crew Demo 1.3.0 is LIVE!New Modifier: Voice StealingIf Voice Stealing is turned on, mimics will have a chance to borrow your teammates' voice for a while!If your voice is stolen by a mimic, you won't hear your own voice. But it will lure your teammates towards the mimic with your voice.This modifier is entirely optional and will not affect XP gain. By default, it is turned off.New Skins & Pricing AdjustmentsNew skins have been added in the game, and a few of them can be purchased in the D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T10:36:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1844751498229304","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2.9 Update","summary":"Demo Update 1.2.9A critical issue was fixed from the 1.2.6, 1.2.7 and 1.2.8 updates where players could not randomly go through doorsA critical issue was fixed where players could not complete the game after going in a safe exitJoin Our Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T14:31:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1844115010496784","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Doomed Crew has a release date!","summary":"Doomed Crew will release on 11th November, on Early Access.What to Expect during Early Access?It will be a hugely extended version of the demo with unlocked progressions, and more:New MapDoomed Crew will likely feature two maps during the early access release. We are planning to include another one more, but we aren't sure if we can include it before the early access release.Objective VarietyDoomed Crew will feature 6, or if possible, more primary objectives by the early access launch. We are pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T07:48:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496784","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1843481262691275","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2.8 Update","summary":"Demo Update 1.2.8A critical issue was fixed from the 1.2.7 update where doors worked erraticallyHealth and oxygen available after being revived are now based on difficultyJoin Our Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T06:15:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1843481262689122","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.2.7: A Bunch of Fixes!","summary":"Demo 1.2.7: A Bunch of Fixes!In this update, we have fixed a lot of sounds, enemy movement and spawn issues and the pacing itself in the demo, and the game is more lightweight and optimized than ever!Enemy & Pacing FixesFixed a critical issue where enemies could clip through walls or floorsEnemies will now spawn slightly less frequentlyFixed an issue where some enemy types could either spawn erratically, or wouldn't spawn at all.Mimics are more likely to flee if attacked with certain weaponsAudi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T13:58:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262689122","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1841579228672835","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.2.6: New Exit Variations, Audio & Visual Improvements","summary":"Demo 1.2.6: New Exit Variations & ImprovementsExit ImprovementsFake exits are easier to determine nowNew exit types: 3 unique variations of exits might be availableGameplay changesPetrifiers will not collide with each other nowDispenser fuel tanks have much better visibility, and empty fuel is shown more prominentlyFixed an issue where some specific keys could not be bound in optionsVisual ImprovementsDark areas have much better visibility overall, and are even more visible based on difficultyNi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T07:20:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228672835","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1840310314338486","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.2.5: Item, UI Improvements & Fixes","summary":"Demo 1.2.5: Item, UI Improvements & FixesImprovementsAir drop flares now will be available to use again if they are thrown indoorsThe respawn/revive button is shown more clearly across menusIf revive kit is available, it ill be shown across menus FixesWe have added a fix to prevent rare player deaths in lobbiesBug report link is changed to steam community instead of formsWe will continue improving the game based on feedback.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T07:53:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338486","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1839041357031750","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2.4 Update","summary":"Demo Update 1.2.4An issue was fixed where multiple players escaping through an exit would not drop itemsPlayers escaping through the Jet Station will drop items nowEnemy spawn & pacing in regular difficulty is slightly changedJoin Our Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-25T11:20:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357031750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1839041357025962","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.2.3: Objective Improvements & Fixes","summary":"Demo 1.2.3: Objective Improvements & FixesWe have fixed many objective & item loss related issues in this update. Also, we have improved stability in throwing items.Objective ImprovementsFixed an issue where frequent objective updates would not show properlyItems that are thrown or are dropped in delivery hatches now also count to the objectiveItems will not \"float\" over the delivery hatch nowFixed an issue where the objective could get updated even when no players were in the objective roomA ne","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T07:55:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357025962","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1837955055363490","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2.2 Update","summary":"Demo Update 1.2.2A new guide is set up at the end phase of the tutorialFixed an issue where secondary objectives could be bypassed, completing them automatically by using soda cansJoin Our Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T13:52:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055363490","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1837955055355794","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2.1 Update","summary":"Demo Update 1.2.1Fixed jittering of hands during movement in bad networkA fix was done to reduce players showing running animation while standingA \"Join Friends\" button is added in the host menuA \"Invite Players\" button is added in the pause menu\"Employee of the month\" posters can now be destroyed with gunshotsMinor network & CPU optimizationJoin Our Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T05:07:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055355794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1836506165570551","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"New Secondary Objectives - Demo 1.2","summary":"Doomed Crew Demo 1.2.0 is LIVE!New Secondary ObjectivesMultiple secondary/optional objectives were added. You will find any two of them randomized per session along with the main objective.Note that: These are entirely optional objectives which carry a bonus if you complete them.There are a total of 5 optional tasks included in the demo. The full game will feature 15+ Randomized optional objectives.New Hosting Option: Friendly DamageFriendly Damage is an option just before you host a lobby.If Fr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T13:45:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570551","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1836506165549869","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1.6: Pick Up System improvements","summary":"Demo 1.1.6: Item pick up fixes and ImprovementsWe have completely overhauled the pick up system in this update. This fixed a lot of problems you might have faced earlier. New Pick-up Fixes Fixed an issue where any item would be wiped from existence if 2 players tried to collect it at the same timePlayers will no longer lose items when picking up stacked stuff (like Chemical stacks)Improved picking and dropping items in bad network conditionsHugely reduced chances of items being missing after pic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T15:49:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165549869","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1835236783563592","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1.5: Balancing, Fixes and Improvements","summary":"Demo 1.1.5 is LIVE! Difficulty Changes & BalancingIncreased the number of real exits in Easy difficultyBalancing improvements for offline/solo players Fixes & ImprovementsNew Field of View (FOV) options are availableFixed an issue where the game would attempt to launch on VR devices (If a VR device was detected). This fix also reduced the size of the game.Fixed a critical issue where progression would get reset within tiersFixed an issue where crouching was not possible in unstable networkFixed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T14:07:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783563592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1834602721194077","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1.4: Difficulty & Progression Fixes","summary":"Demo 1.1.4 is LIVE! Changes in DifficultyWe have added new \"Very Hard\" difficulty, high risk, get 2X XP!Easy mode improved, and it is now more beginner friendly.Number of real exits now vary based on difficulty selected. Changes in Progression Higher difficulties now unlock through progression! Play on \"Regular\" once to unlock \"Hard\" modePlay on \"Hard\" once to unlock \"Very Hard\" mode Tier 2 XP cap is slightly increased. FixesFixed a rare issue where invisible items could spawn on tablesFixed an ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T16:06:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194077","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1834602721186623","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"2500 Wishlists! Thank you! What's next?","summary":"Doomed Crew has crossed 2500 Wishlists!A big thank you to everyone! We will be targeting both minor and major changes on Doomed Crew, soon!What's Next?Difficulty changesWe are planning to include a new, easier difficulty and add difficulty unlocks by progression.Secondary/Bonus ObjectivesThese will give you a considerable bonus, only if you can complete them. These are entirely optional, by the way!New SkinsMore cosmetics are coming, and some of them will be available in the demo!And..Thank you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T05:56:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721186623","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1833334318579413","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1.3: Spectator mode tips & death causes","summary":"Demo 1.1.3 Patch NotesSpectator mode now includes death causes and/or tipsSome death causes of a player will be shown to everyoneNew brightness slider options are availableFixed an issue where some host names in the menu would not show properlyVending machines now react when shotMore updates coming soon! We are improving the game based on feedback.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T13:44:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318579413","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4119020-1833334318568711","game_id":"steam-4119020","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1.2: Voice Improvements & Pacing Fixes","summary":"Demo 1.1.2 Patch NotesNew Mic Volume options are availableReviving & Pinging prompts are much clearer to understand nowEnemy pacing improvements, spawn rate modificationsFixes in multiple areas where enemies would get stuckFixed an issue where vo